  "body_html": "<div class=\"follower-sheet\" data-sheet=\"inventory\">\n<p>Quand tu <strong><em>t'Équipes</em></strong>, coche un nombre de ◇ ci-dessous, sur des objets précis ou en Indéfini.</p>\n<ul class=\"bullets\">\n<li>Pour une <strong>charge légère</strong> (<em>rapide et silencieux</em>), coche jusqu'à 3 ◇</li>\n<li>Pour une <strong>charge normale</strong>, coche 4-6 ◇</li>\n<li>Pour une <strong>charge lourde</strong> (<em>bruyant, lent, suffocant, vite épuisant</em>), coche 7-9 ◇</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"undefined\">Indéfini</h3>\n<div class=\"fs-uses\"><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"inv-undef\"><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-0\" title=\"Coche 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-0\" aria-label=\"Coche 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-1\" title=\"Coche 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-1\" aria-label=\"Coche 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-2\" title=\"Coche 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-2\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-2\" aria-label=\"Coche 3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-3\" title=\"Coche 4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-3\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-3\" aria-label=\"Coche 4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-4\" title=\"Coche 5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-4\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-4\" aria-label=\"Coche 5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-5\" title=\"Coche 6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-5\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-5\" aria-label=\"Coche 6\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-6\" title=\"Coche 7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-6\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-6\" aria-label=\"Coche 7\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-7\" title=\"Coche 8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-7\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-7\" aria-label=\"Coche 8\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-8\" title=\"Coche 9\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-8\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-8\" aria-label=\"Coche 9\"></label></span></div></div>\n<p>Quand tu <strong><em>As ce qu'il Faut</em></strong>, déplace une coche d'ici vers un ◇ précis ci-dessous.</p>\n<h3 id=\"gear\">Équipement</h3>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-supplies-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-supplies-0\" aria-label=\"Emplacement\"></span><label for=\"inv-supplies-0\"><span><strong>Fournitures</strong> (4+Prospérité utilisations ○○○○ ○○)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-more-supplies-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-more-supplies-0\" aria-label=\"Emplacement\"></span><label for=\"inv-more-supplies-0\"><span><strong>Fournitures en plus</strong> (4+Prospérité utilisations ○○○○ ○○)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-even-more-supplies-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-even-more-supplies-0\" aria-label=\"Emplacement\"></span><label for=\"inv-even-more-supplies-0\"><span><strong>Encore des fournitures</strong> (4+Prospérité utilisations ○○○○ ○○)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"fs-muted\"><em>Utilise les fournitures pour Récupérer, Monter le Camp, ou avoir des <em>petits</em> objets en plus.</em></p>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-mess-kit-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-mess-kit-0\" aria-label=\"Emplacement\"></span><label for=\"inv-mess-kit-0\"><span><strong>Kit de popote</strong> (requiert feu et eau ; fait durer les Fournitures plus longtemps)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-bedroll-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-bedroll-0\" aria-label=\"Emplacement\"></span><label for=\"inv-bedroll-0\"><span><strong>Sac de couchage</strong> (récupère 1d6 HP de plus quand tu Montes le Camp)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-blanket-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-blanket-0\" aria-label=\"Emplacement\"></span><label for=\"inv-blanket-0\"><span><strong>Couverture</strong> (<em>chaud</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-change-of-clothes-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-change-of-clothes-0\" aria-label=\"Emplacement\"></span><label for=\"inv-change-of-clothes-0\"><span><strong>Vêtements de rechange</strong></span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-rope-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-rope-0\" aria-label=\"Emplacement\"></span><label for=\"inv-rope-0\"><span><strong>Corde</strong>, ~25 pieds</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-shovel-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-shovel-0\" aria-label=\"Emplacement\"></span><label for=\"inv-shovel-0\"><span><strong>Pelle</strong></span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-sledge-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-sledge-0\" aria-label=\"Emplacement\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-sledge-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-sledge-1\" aria-label=\"Emplacement\"></span><label for=\"inv-sledge-0\"><span><strong>Luge/civière/travois</strong>, enroulable</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-snow-shoes-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-snow-shoes-0\" aria-label=\"Emplacement\"></span><label for=\"inv-snow-shoes-0\"><span><strong>Raquettes à neige</strong></span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-torch-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-torch-0\" aria-label=\"Emplacement\"></span><label for=\"inv-torch-0\"><span><strong>Torche</strong> (dure ~1 heure ; <em>allonge</em>, <em>zone</em>, <em>dangereux</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-oil-lamp-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-oil-lamp-0\" aria-label=\"Emplacement\"></span><label for=\"inv-oil-lamp-0\"><span><strong>Lampe à huile</strong> (○○○ heures, <em>rapproché</em>, <em>zone</em>, <em>grossier</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-extra-oil-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-extra-oil-0\" aria-label=\"Emplacement\"></span><label for=\"inv-extra-oil-0\"><span><strong>Huile en plus</strong> (○○○○○ heures, pour lampe/lanterne, inutile comme arme)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-firewood-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-firewood-0\" aria-label=\"Emplacement\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-firewood-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-firewood-1\" aria-label=\"Emplacement\"></span><label for=\"inv-firewood-0\"><span><strong>Bois de chauffage</strong> (de quoi tenir 1 nuit entière, <em>allonge</em>, <em>zone</em>)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-hatchet-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-hatchet-0\" aria-label=\"Emplacement\"></span><label for=\"inv-hatchet-0\"><span><strong>Hachette</strong>, fer (<em>main</em>, <em>de jet</em>, x perforant)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-mallet-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-mallet-0\" aria-label=\"Emplacement\"></span><label for=\"inv-mallet-0\"><span><strong>Maillet</strong>, fer et/ou bois (<em>main</em>)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-mattock-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-mattock-0\" aria-label=\"Emplacement\"></span><label for=\"inv-mattock-0\"><span><strong>Pioche</strong>, fer (<em>rapproché</em>, x perforant, <em>sanglant</em>, <em>encombrant</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-maul-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-maul-0\" aria-label=\"Emplacement\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-maul-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-maul-1\" aria-label=\"Emplacement\"></span><label for=\"inv-maul-0\"><span><strong>Masse</strong>, fer (<em>rapproché</em>, <em>percutant</em>, <em>encombrant</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-staff-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-staff-0\" aria-label=\"Emplacement\"></span><label for=\"inv-staff-0\"><span><strong>Bâton</strong> (<em>rapproché</em>)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-spear-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-spear-0\" aria-label=\"Emplacement\"></span><label for=\"inv-spear-0\"><span><strong>Lance</strong>, fer (<em>rapproché</em>, <em>de jet</em>, x perforant)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-long-spear-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-long-spear-0\" aria-label=\"Emplacement\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-long-spear-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-long-spear-1\" aria-label=\"Emplacement\"></span><label for=\"inv-long-spear-0\"><span><strong>Lance longue</strong>, fer (<em>allonge</em>, x perforant)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-bow-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-bow-0\" aria-label=\"Emplacement\"></span><label for=\"inv-bow-0\"><span><strong>Arc et flèches de fer</strong> (<em>proche</em>, x perforant, ○ munitions faibles, ○ épuisées)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-extra-arrows-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-extra-arrows-0\" aria-label=\"Emplacement\"></span><label for=\"inv-extra-arrows-0\"><span><strong>Flèches en plus</strong> (x perforant, ○ en quantité, ○ munitions faibles, ○ épuisées)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-javelins-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-javelins-0\" aria-label=\"Emplacement\"></span><label for=\"inv-javelins-0\"><span><strong>Javelots</strong>, quelques-uns, fer (<em>de jet</em>, x perforant, +1 dégât, ○ épuisés)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-shield-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-shield-0\" aria-label=\"Emplacement\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-shield-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-shield-1\" aria-label=\"Emplacement\"></span><label for=\"inv-shield-0\"><span><strong>Bouclier</strong> (+1 armure, +1 Préparation sur 7+ pour Défendre)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-thick-hides-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-thick-hides-0\" aria-label=\"Emplacement\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-thick-hides-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-thick-hides-1\" aria-label=\"Emplacement\"></span><label for=\"inv-thick-hides-0\"><span><strong>Peaux épaisses</strong> (1 armure, <em>chaud</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-cloak-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-cloak-0\" aria-label=\"Emplacement\"></span><label for=\"inv-cloak-0\"><span><strong>Manteau</strong> (<em>chaud</em>)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"possessions-items-loot\">Possessions, objets, butin</h3>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot0-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot0-0\" aria-label=\"Emplacement\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot0\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Objet\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot1-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot1-0\" aria-label=\"Emplacement\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot1\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Objet\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot2-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot2-0\" aria-label=\"Emplacement\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot2\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Objet\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot3-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot3-0\" aria-label=\"Emplacement\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot3\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Objet\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot4-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot4-0\" aria-label=\"Emplacement\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot4\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Objet\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot5-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot5-0\" aria-label=\"Emplacement\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot5\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Objet\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot6-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot6-0\" aria-label=\"Emplacement\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot6\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Objet\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot7-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot7-0\" aria-label=\"Emplacement\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot7\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Objet\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"other-things\">Autres choses</h3>\n<p class=\"fs-muted\">(animaux, kits, objets mis de côté, etc.)</p>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-notes\"><textarea class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:other-things\" rows=\"2\" aria-label=\"Autres choses\"></textarea></div>\n<h3 id=\"small-items\">Petits objets</h3>\n<p>Tiennent dans une poche, une bourse ou une botte. Quand tu <strong><em>t'Équipes</em></strong>, coche ☐ ci-dessous à hauteur de 4+Prospérité.</p>\n<div class=\"fs-uses\"><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"inv-small-undef\"><span class=\"track-label\">Indéfini</span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-0\" title=\"Coche 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-0\" aria-label=\"Coche 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-1\" title=\"Coche 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-1\" aria-label=\"Coche 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-2\" title=\"Coche 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-2\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-2\" aria-label=\"Coche 3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-3\" title=\"Coche 4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-3\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-3\" aria-label=\"Coche 4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-4\" title=\"Coche 5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-4\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-4\" aria-label=\"Coche 5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-5\" title=\"Coche 6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-5\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-5\" aria-label=\"Coche 6\"></label></span></div></div>\n<p>Quand tu <strong><em>As ce qu'il Faut</em></strong>, déplace une coche d'ici vers les objets ci-dessous, ou dépense des fournitures pour cocher un ☐ de plus.</p>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list inv-small\">\n<li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-knife\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-knife\" data-check-id=\"inv-knife\"> <span><strong>Couteau ou dague</strong>, fer (<em>main</em>)</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-sling\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-sling\" data-check-id=\"inv-sling\"> <span><strong>Fronde</strong> (<em>proche</em>, <em>rechargement</em>, <em>encombrant</em>, ○ munitions faibles, ○ épuisées)</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label f